   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<p>What could you conclude about these two lines?</p>\n\n<ol>\n  <li>Line A has a slope of <span data-math=\"{-4.7}\">{-4.7}</span>.\n</li>\n  <li>Line B has a slope of <span data-math=\"12.0\">12.0</span>.\n</li>\n</ol>\n",
   "answers": [
